1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,050
Why do golf balls have dimples?

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:03,321
Oh, I KNOW this one.

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,196
The dimples are just ugly! Smooth flies better.

4
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:11,400
Actually...

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,894
Dimples make the air hug the ball,

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,322
so the wake behind it shrinks.

7
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:19,214
Less drag. It flies twice as far.

8
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,457
Wait. Why do tennis balls have fuzz?
